<article class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-8">
    <header class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">
            OnnaSoft · Business technology
        </p>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">
            Our Vision: To Be a Global Reference in Innovative and Scalable
            Technological Solutions
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-gray-500">
            At OnnaSoft, our vision is to become a global reference in
            innovative, secure, and scalable technology solutions that empower
            businesses to grow, adapt, and compete in an increasingly digital
            world. We aspire to transform complex challenges into practical
            opportunities through software engineering, intelligent automation,
            cloud technologies, data-driven insights, and continuous innovation.
        </p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Building a Future Driven by Technology and Innovation
        </h2>

        <p>
            Technology continues to transform how businesses operate, interact
            with customers, and create value. Organizations must constantly
            adapt to new digital capabilities, changing market expectations, and
            increasingly complex operational requirements to remain competitive.
        </p>

        <p>
            At OnnaSoft, we envision a future in which businesses of different
            sizes can access the technology and expertise needed to overcome
            their challenges and achieve their ambitions. We believe innovation
            should be practical, accessible, and directly connected to
            measurable business outcomes.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our vision goes beyond developing software. We aim to help
            organizations rethink processes, modernize their infrastructure,
            connect their systems, and discover new opportunities through
            technology. Every solution represents an opportunity to simplify
            complexity and create lasting business value.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Becoming a Global Reference in Technology Solutions
        </h2>

        <p>
            Becoming a global reference means building a reputation for
            technical excellence, reliability, and meaningful innovation. We
            aspire to work with organizations across industries and markets,
            delivering solutions that respond to their specific requirements
            while meeting high standards of quality and maintainability.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our long-term vision includes expanding our capabilities, embracing
            emerging technologies, and developing partnerships that allow us to
            address increasingly complex business challenges. We recognize that
            global relevance is earned through consistent execution, strong
            relationships, and solutions that deliver real value.
        </p>

        <p>
            By combining engineering expertise with a deep understanding of
            business needs, we aim to help organizations build better digital
            products, improve operational performance, and accelerate their
            technology initiatives regardless of where they operate.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Innovation That Solves Real-World Problems
        </h2>

        <p>
            Innovation is most valuable when it addresses a genuine need. New
            technologies create opportunities, but their impact depends on how
            effectively they are applied to business challenges. Our vision
            emphasizes purposeful innovation that improves processes, enables
            new capabilities, and supports better decisions.
        </p>

        <p>
            We see significant opportunities in custom software development,
            artificial intelligence, machine learning, data engineering, cloud
            computing, API integration, and enterprise automation. These
            technologies can help organizations reduce manual work, improve
            access to information, and develop more efficient digital
            operations.
        </p>

        <p>
            We aspire to continuously evaluate emerging tools and engineering
            practices, selecting those that provide meaningful benefits. This
            approach allows us to pursue innovation while maintaining
            appropriate attention to security, reliability, usability, and
            long-term technical sustainability.
        </p>
    </section>

    <figure class="my-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
        <img
